<td align="left" valign="top">TP53BP2 promoter<br>TP53BP2<br>Tumor protein p53 binding protein, 2 promoter; apoptosis-stimulating protein of p53, 2 promoter. Note that due to the absence of an annotated DNA molecule identifier, the listed GI refers to the entire chromosome 1 genomic sequence. The sequence range [220274526-220340354], which encodes the TP53BP2 gene, was inferred from the GI. The sequence range of the TP53BP2 promoter was not specified.<br>Tumor protein p53-binding protein, 2 promoter; apoptosis-stimulating protein of p53, 2 promoter. Note that due to the absence of an annotated DNA molecule identifier, the listed GI refers to the entire chromosome 1 genomic sequence. The sequence range [220274526-220340354], which encodes the TP53BP2 gene, was inferred from the GI. The sequence range of the TP53BP2 promoter was not specified.</td>
